OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785692892
OL,3,CFormer British Army soldier Nirmal
OL,4,CPurja confirmed dead in Pakistan
OL,5,Cavalanche
OL,7,FFormer British Army and Royal Marines
OL,8,Fsoldier Nirmal Purja has been
OL,9,Fconfirmed by the company he set up as
OL,10,Fone of those killed in an avalanche in
OL,11,FPakistan.
OL,13,FThe Nepalese mountaineer was leading
OL,14,Fan expedition of 10 climbers on Brad
OL,15,FPeak, the world's 12th highest
OL,16,Fmountain, in the north of the country
OL,17,Fwhen the avalanche struck at about
OL,18,Fmidday on Thursday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
