PN,31502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785692892
OL,3,CFormer British Army soldier Nirmal
OL,4,CPurja confirmed dead in Pakistan
OL,5,Cavalanche
OL,7,FFollowing search efforts, his company
OL,8,FElite Exped has now confirmed Nirmal
OL,9,Fwas killed.
OL,11,FIn a post shared on Instagram, the
OL,12,Fcompany said: "Today, it is with
OL,13,Fprofound sadness and immense
OL,14,Fheartbreak that we confirm that Nirmal
OL,15,F'Nimsdai' Purja, tragically lost his
OL,16,Flife following the avalanche on Broad
OL,17,FPeak. We have also received
OL,18,Fconfirmation that other members of
OL,19,Fthis expedition sadly did not survive.
OL,26,@tD@OOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785692892
OL,3,CFormer British Army soldier Nirmal
OL,4,CPurja confirmed dead in Pakistan
OL,5,Cavalanche
OL,7,F"Today, we mourn not only Nims, but
OL,8,Fevery life lost in this tragedy,
OL,9,Fincluding his trusted climbing
OL,10,Fpartners and guides, Pur Bahadur
OL,11,FGurung (Yukta) and Nima Sherpa.
OL,13,F"Our deepest thoughts, prayers and
OL,14,Fheartfelt condolences are with their
OL,15,Ffamilies, friends and loved ones. No
OL,16,Fwords can erase the pain of this
OL,17,Funimaginable loss, and we ask that
OL,18,Feveryone respects their privacy as
OL,19,Fthey grieve."
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOU{D@MO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/10
