PN,31504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785692892
OL,3,CFormer British Army soldier Nirmal
OL,4,CPurja confirmed dead in Pakistan
OL,5,Cavalanche
OL,7,FBritish adventurer Bear Grylls also
OL,8,Fpaid tribute to Purja, writing on
OL,9,FInstagram: "Heartbreaking news for so
OL,10,Fmany climbers around the world who had
OL,11,Fa relationship with this remarkable
OL,12,Fand unique man. We will never forget
OL,13,Fyou Nims and your unstoppable spirit."
OL,15,FAlong with Mr Grylls, Mr Purja was
OL,16,Fenlisted by former Made in Chelsea
OL,17,Fstar Spencer Matthews to help recover
OL,18,Fthe body of his brother Michael, the
OL,19,Fyoungest Briton to summit Everest who
OL,20,Fdisappeared on the mountain in 1999.
OL,26,@qD@LOUuD@fO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/10
