PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785692892
OL,3,CFormer British Army soldier Nirmal
OL,4,CPurja confirmed dead in Pakistan
OL,5,Cavalanche
OL,7,FTheir efforts were captured in the
OL,8,Fdocumentary Finding Michael, which was
OL,9,Freleased in 2023.
OL,11,FEarlier on Saturday, Mr Matthews said
OL,12,Fhe was praying "for a miracle".
OL,14,FMr Matthews shared a photo with the
OL,15,Fmountaineer on Instagram and said the
OL,16,Fnews from Broad Peak was
OL,17,F"heartbreaking".
OL,19,FThe 37-year-old said in the post: "The
OL,20,Fmountains inspire us with their beauty
OL,21,Fbut they also demand immense respect.
OL,26,@tD@POUtD@^O]yD@AOUyD@OO]{D@cOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/10
