OL,3,CFormer British Army soldier Nirmal
OL,4,CPurja confirmed dead in Pakistan
OL,5,Cavalanche
OL,7,F"Every person who ventures into that
OL,8,Fworld understands the risks, yet they
OL,9,Fgo anyway, driven by curiosity,
OL,10,Fpurpose, passion and a deep love for
OL,11,Fthe places few will ever experience.
OL,26,@oD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/10
