PN,31507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785692892
OL,3,CFormer British Army soldier Nirmal
OL,4,CPurja confirmed dead in Pakistan
OL,5,Cavalanche
OL,7,F"The news from Broad Peak is
OL,8,Fheartbreaking. So many lives,
OL,9,Ffamilies, friends and teammates now
OL,10,Ffacing unimaginable loss. Our thoughts
OL,11,Fare with everyone affected by this
OL,12,Ftragedy. May those who have been lost
OL,13,Fbe remembered not only for how they
OL,14,Fdied, but for how they lived, the
OL,15,Fcourage they showed, and the lived
OL,16,Fthey touched. Rest in peace. To those
OL,17,Fnot yet found, we pray for a miracle."
OL,26,@oD@AOUyD@fO]
