PN,31508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785692892
OL,3,CFormer British Army soldier Nirmal
OL,4,CPurja confirmed dead in Pakistan
OL,5,Cavalanche
OL,7,FMr Purja rose to prominence in 2019
OL,8,Fwhen he climbed all 14 of the world's
OL,9,Fmountains with peaks above 8,000
OL,10,Fmetres (26,247ft) in 189 days `
OL,11,Fsmashing the previous record by more
OL,12,Fthan seven years.
OL,14,FThe challenge was the focus of a
OL,15,FNetflix documentary called 14 Peaks:
OL,16,FNothing Is Impossible.
OL,18,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,19,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,20,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,21,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/10
