PN,31509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785692892
OL,3,CFormer British Army soldier Nirmal
OL,4,CPurja confirmed dead in Pakistan
OL,5,Cavalanche
OL,7,FMr Purja, 43, powered to the top of
OL,8,Fthe mountains, each with peaks in the
OL,9,Fso-called "death zone", starting with
OL,10,FAnnapurna on April 23 2019 and taking
OL,11,Fin Everest in May and K2 in July.
OL,13,FHe served in the British military for
OL,14,F16 years, 10 of which were spent in
OL,15,Fthe special forces, and he was awarded
OL,16,Fan MBE by the late Queen in 2018 for
OL,17,Fhis achievement in extreme high-
OL,18,Faltitude mountaineering.
OL,26,@qD@KOUqD@VO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/10
