PN,31510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785692892
OL,3,CFormer British Army soldier Nirmal
OL,4,CPurja confirmed dead in Pakistan
OL,5,Cavalanche
OL,7,FThe cold weather warfare specialist
OL,8,Fsaid he was the first Gurkha to climb
OL,9,FEverest while serving in the British
OL,10,Fmilitary.
OL,12,FIn 2016, he broke mountaineering
OL,13,Fconventions to rescue a climber left
OL,14,Fin the "Everest death zone", bringing
OL,15,Fher to safety alone.
OL,26,@vD@HOUvD@[O]
